{"about_the_game":"<strong>The space sport &quot;SUPER UFO FIGHTER&quot; is all the rage in the galaxy.<br>And UFO pilots, known as Shwoopers, are battling it out today!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Shuforians compete in intense 1v1 battles for supremacy!\u25c6</h2>Deposit the &quot;<i>target</i>&quot; item into your goal to score.<br>The key to victory is to control the stage items!<br>Use your shwoop beam to collect the target before your rival and bring it home!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/b0d16fc2f4f51d25c12ec7035b4725de.poster.avif?t=1766556584\" width=524 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/b0d16fc2f4f51d25c12ec7035b4725de.webm?t=1766556584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/b0d16fc2f4f51d25c12ec7035b4725de.mp4?t=1766556584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Or use the beam to intercept, throw, and attack your opponent!<br>Anything goes when trying to get the prize!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/72ec2617d74ba26175af58a0ab876662.poster.avif?t=1766556584\" width=524 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/72ec2617d74ba26175af58a0ab876662.webm?t=1766556584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277870/extras/72ec2617d74ba26175af58a0ab876662.mp4?t=1766556584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use the stage gimmicks and special items to your advantage to win!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline 